<title>USA: AmExpress funds change paper listing.</title>
<headline>AmExpress funds change paper listing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Express Co's Financial Advisors unit said it was changing the newspaper listings of its mutual funds to American Express/IDS from IDS Mutual Fund Group.</p>
<p>It said the change will be effective December 18.</p>
<p>It said the change was part of a company rebranding effort to focus on the American Express name.</p>
